@baseUrl = https://vv7z192paj.execute-api.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com
@phone = +919051495239

### Send OTP SMS (phone + otp from API)
POST {{baseUrl}}/otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{phone}}",
  "otp": "482910"
}

### Send OTP SMS (API generates OTP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{phone}}"
}

### Custom OTP message
POST {{baseUrl}}/otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobile": "{{phone}}",
  "otp": "123456",
  "message": "Your login OTP is 123456"
}

### Missing phone (expects 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "otp": "111111"
}
